1
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,130
Sis!

2
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,460
[Episode 4] What's the problem?

3
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,750
What's got your face all burning up?

4
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:22,980
Did you fart in front of Yun?

5
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:28,750
Hurry up and go! I need to pee, too!

6
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:32,950
Go to Yun's. I'm constipated.

7
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,960
What is it?

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,930
What should I do, Minchae?

9
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,350
Are you constipated, too?

10
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:48,200
There's a guy who came from Australia to see me.

11
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,160
What?

12
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:52,690
I met him when I followed Yun to shoot his ad.

13
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:54,950
He helped me out a lot.

14
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:57,120
You have a boyfriend?

15
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:00,020
No. I don't like him. He likes me.

16
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:02,750
He likes you but you don't like him?

17
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:03,960
Yeah.

18
00:01:04,970 --> 00:01:10,130
It seems he's fallen for me.
I feel so sorry, what I should I do?

19
00:01:10,130 --> 00:01:11,880
He's fallen for you...

20
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:14,080
So you're saying he's come all the way
from Australia for you.

21
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:16,220
Yes!

22
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:18,650
Did you sleep with him?

23
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:19,500
Huh?

24
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,580
Did you?

25
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,990
Yes.

26
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:28,240
I was freezing to death, so we held each other.

27
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:32,360
I think that's when he started to fall for me.

28
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:35,290
Are you crazy?

29
00:01:35,290 --> 00:01:41,050
Oh my god...
It's always the quiet ones.

30
00:01:41,050 --> 00:01:43,080
That's what I'm saying.

31
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:45,520
And it's you who did it, not me.

32
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,930
It's the end of the world as we know it.

33
00:01:47,930 --> 00:01:51,800
No. It's not like that.

34
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,850
Oh, my...

35
00:01:52,850 --> 00:01:55,870
Oh, how disgusting.

36
00:01:55,870 --> 00:02:01,560
For how many hours have you guys
been talking here?

37
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:05,140
Sukchae, aren't you done?

38
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:07,890
Eunchae, Minchae. Aren't you done yet?

39
00:02:07,890 --> 00:02:10,040
We are done. We'll be out soon.

40
00:02:10,040 --> 00:02:12,200
Then come out.

41
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:16,600
Your father has to use the bathroom, too!

42
00:02:17,310 --> 00:02:18,790
Mom!

43
00:02:18,790 --> 00:02:19,760
What?

44
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:23,830
Eunchae said she slept with a guy.
I hear wedding bells.

45
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:28,570
No! We did sleep together but not in that way!

46
00:02:28,570 --> 00:02:31,760
- What?
- No, no!

47
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,110
It's not like that!

48
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:35,010
Mom!

49
00:02:35,010 --> 00:02:37,890
- Stop right there!
- Mom!

50
00:02:37,890 --> 00:02:40,740
You, stop right there!

51
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:42,690
No, it's not like that!

52
00:02:42,690 --> 00:02:48,440
Come here, Song Eunchae!

53
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,770
Why, you little!

54
00:02:50,770 --> 00:02:52,450
No. It's not what you think!

55
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,730
I would never...

56
00:03:16,730 --> 00:03:20,360
I haven't even had my first kiss!

57
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:46,990
Now I'm seeing things.

58
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:51,790
I feel so sorry.

59
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:03,280
- Eunchae!
- Going somewhere?

60
00:04:04,223 --> 00:04:06,060
To see my brother.

61
00:04:06,060 --> 00:04:07,390
- Your brother?
- Yes.

62
00:04:07,390 --> 00:04:10,160
Oh. Have some.

63
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,230
What is this?

64
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:12,600
Mountain ginseng.

65
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:13,580
Huh?

66
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:16,220
They added some honey on the mountain ginseng
or something like that.

67
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:17,810
Eat it.

68
00:04:17,810 --> 00:04:19,730
How can I eat such an expensive thing?

69
00:04:19,730 --> 00:04:22,130
That's exactly why you should eat it.

70
00:04:22,130 --> 00:04:26,380
I don't want to. Your mother bought it for you.

71
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:30,620
Hey, I can't eat this.

72
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:34,800
How could I? You eat it.

73
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:37,580
Then I'm going to feed it to the dogs.

74
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,940
Why can't you eat this?

75
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:42,360
My mouth is my mouth. Is your mouth dirty then?

76
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,520
Yun...

77
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:46,110
Give it so I can give it to the dog next door.

78
00:04:46,110 --> 00:04:50,630
Hey, okay! I'll eat it.

79
00:04:55,090 --> 00:04:57,720
- Better?
- Yes.

80
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:03,020
My mom says she feels the best
when she gives me good food.

81
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:06,710
I feel the best when I give you good food.

82
00:05:06,710 --> 00:05:09,870
I must have been your mom or dad, in our past lives.

83
00:05:11,050 --> 00:05:15,530
Eat well and grow up big and strong, okay?

84
00:05:15,530 --> 00:05:17,430
- Son!
- Yes?

85
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:19,980
Yun, put this on and go.

86
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:21,020
What is that?

87
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:25,640
This is powdered pearl and mink oils.

88
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:29,170
It's great for crow's feet.

89
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:31,240
Where do I have crow's feet?

90
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:34,530
It's called prevention!

91
00:05:34,530 --> 00:05:40,260
If you get so much as a single
mark on that face, I'll just die!

92
00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:45,900
Eunchae, so what happened with that guy?

93
00:05:47,130 --> 00:05:48,500
Guy?

94
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:52,010
Sure. Eunchae's got a boyfriend now.

95
00:05:52,900 --> 00:05:55,800
Eunchae has a boyfriend?

96
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,000
Yes.

97
00:05:57,580 --> 00:06:00,140
Who is it? What does he do?

98
00:06:00,140 --> 00:06:04,530
He must be sensitive.
He likes her so much he was in tears.

99
00:06:04,530 --> 00:06:07,670
Eunchae, be good.

100
00:06:07,670 --> 00:06:12,550
If you make someone else cry,
then your eyes will cry blood.

101
00:06:14,850 --> 00:06:17,330
Good luck, Eunchae.

102
00:06:17,330 --> 00:06:19,570
Congratulations, you fake prude!

103
00:06:42,730 --> 00:06:44,910
What on earth kind of guy is he?

104
00:06:46,810 --> 00:06:50,670
Eunchae has awful standards when it comes to guys.

105
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:57,120
Why am I so upset?

106
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:21,770
Brother!

107
00:08:21,770 --> 00:08:22,920
Get in!

108
00:08:35,430 --> 00:08:36,870
I was...

109
00:09:46,550 --> 00:09:47,680
Hey!

110
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:09,660
That's the kind of woman she is.

111
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:16,030
She'll destroy whatever's in her way.

112
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:24,840
Child, and everything. Toss it all out!

113
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:20,500
Water tastes great, doesn't it?

114
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:25,990
I had a cramp.

115
00:12:27,710 --> 00:12:29,750
I almost died.

116
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:35,450
You can't let it know you fear it.

117
00:12:35,450 --> 00:12:37,570
You have to win and stamp it out.

118
00:12:37,570 --> 00:12:40,050
That's the only way you make friends with water.

119
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:03,940
- Brother.
- Yeah.

120
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:06,550
When'd you learn how to swim?

121
00:13:06,550 --> 00:13:07,940
I didn't learn.

122
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:11,280
You weren't taught?

123
00:13:15,690 --> 00:13:17,960
But I haven't learned, either.

124
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:22,240
Then what do I do to become as good as you?

125
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:25,510
Try your best!

126
00:13:25,510 --> 00:13:28,390
Then I guess I should come here more often.

127
00:13:28,390 --> 00:13:30,760
But I don't swim!

128
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:33,410
What are you doing?

129
00:13:39,650 --> 00:13:41,400
You need to wash better!

130
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:46,540
Let me see your back.

131
00:13:46,540 --> 00:13:54,780
When I think of my mother,
I feel grateful and I start to cry,

132
00:13:54,780 --> 00:14:00,650
She gave birth to me, and raised me well.

133
00:14:00,650 --> 00:14:04,490
And gives me endless love.

134
00:14:05,410 --> 00:14:09,500
Mom, you are my sunshine. My world.

135
00:14:14,530 --> 00:14:16,020
How is it?

136
00:14:16,020 --> 00:14:18,200
It's good.

137
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:20,580
But this place...

138
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:27,110
It seems...

139
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:31,320
Look over here.

140
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:35,980
Stripes look great on Yun.

141
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:37,920
This is the fifth one, ma'am.

142
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,250
Oh, yeah?

143
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:45,920
This style wouldn't work on anyone but Yun, right?

144
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,290
Yeah, sure.

145
00:14:48,460 --> 00:14:50,950
But, ma'am, this place is extremely expensive.

146
00:14:50,950 --> 00:14:56,470
Red looks great on my son as well.

147
00:14:58,190 --> 00:14:59,740
One second...

148
00:15:00,770 --> 00:15:04,590
Having a great son is hard work, too.

149
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,320
Yes, manager.

150
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:14,910
Yun? You can't reach him?

151
00:15:15,850 --> 00:15:19,160
He said he was going to meet up with his "brother."

152
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:21,720
I don't know what he was talking about.

153
00:15:22,290 --> 00:15:24,330
Newspapers?

154
00:15:24,330 --> 00:15:26,300
No, I didn't see them.

155
00:15:27,610 --> 00:15:28,730
What?

156
00:15:29,970 --> 00:15:32,700
["Choi Yun Got Used by Kang Minju!]

157
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:38,430
["Kang Minju reveals all:
Love's just a game to me, I was only playing"]

158
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:44,050
"Out of rice?"

159
00:15:53,950 --> 00:15:57,820
I have to go somewhere. I'll see you later.

160
00:15:59,070 --> 00:16:01,090
"You're going to drive drunk?"

161
00:16:02,050 --> 00:16:03,920
"Let me see your license!"

162
00:16:11,430 --> 00:16:15,340
Your head won't bust that way. Want a hammer?

163
00:16:19,660 --> 00:16:25,280
I'm going to kill myself and her today.

164
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:27,280
No one better stop me.

165
00:16:37,310 --> 00:16:39,720
Come in, Eunchae! Door's open!

166
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,810
Wait, just one more round...

167
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,500
This is a false report, right?

168
00:16:49,500 --> 00:16:51,600
Go clear it up with Yun.

169
00:16:53,990 --> 00:16:56,280
It came out exactly as I said in the interview.

170
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:58,250
You wanna die?

171
00:16:58,250 --> 00:16:59,770
You wanna get beaten?

172
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:06,530
Do you have any idea how much Yun loves you?

173
00:17:06,530 --> 00:17:09,570
Yun's different from all your other guys!

174
00:17:10,770 --> 00:17:12,350
Sorry.

175
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:16,660
It's just how I am.

176
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:20,710
You know I'm a flirt by nature.

177
00:17:23,050 --> 00:17:26,560
Why do you live this way, huh? Why?

178
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:28,680
You're better than that!

179
00:17:31,090 --> 00:17:34,250
Is this the way you want to live, you brat?

180
00:17:34,250 --> 00:17:37,280
Why do you live so recklessly? Want to end your career?

181
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:40,170
Are you a blockhead? Are you an idiot?

182
00:17:40,170 --> 00:17:43,190
Why do stupid things willingly?

183
00:17:43,850 --> 00:17:46,130
Have you decided to end it all?

184
00:17:46,130 --> 00:17:48,840
You idiot, you dummy, you moron!

185
00:17:51,330 --> 00:17:52,930
You done hitting me?

186
00:17:55,190 --> 00:17:57,920
Is that all you've got?

187
00:17:57,920 --> 00:18:01,980
You should break my rib or something.

188
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:11,460
Yun... I think I like him.

189
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:17,960
I think because of that...

190
00:18:19,500 --> 00:18:23,480
Maybe because I was really starting to like him...

191
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:25,740
That's why I did it.

192
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:27,040
What?

193
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,540
You like Yun, don't you?

194
00:18:30,540 --> 00:18:31,690
Hey!

195
00:18:32,470 --> 00:18:35,480
I've got a PhD in relationships.

196
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:39,660
You think I wouldn't know? I've known for a long time.

197
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:42,790
Who's heard of a friendship between a guy and a girl?

198
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:45,280
What on earth are you talking about?

199
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:47,900
Do you really want to get smacked today?

200
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:53,480
Still, I wanted to play dumb and go all the way,

201
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:57,930
but I couldn't because of you.

202
00:18:57,930 --> 00:18:59,680
You have him.

203
00:19:00,590 --> 00:19:02,280
You can have him.

204
00:19:04,670 --> 00:19:08,450
That's right. You should get smacked.

205
00:19:08,450 --> 00:19:11,790
You need a beating bring get you back to your senses.

206
00:19:11,790 --> 00:19:15,740
I'm going to break your ribs and your legs!

207
00:19:15,740 --> 00:19:18,610
You're dead meat, Kang Minju!

208
00:19:19,430 --> 00:19:21,580
Can't you stop that, Eunchae?

209
00:19:23,470 --> 00:19:25,470
What do you think you're doing?

210
00:19:25,470 --> 00:19:30,650
Are you a thug?
What gives you the right to hit her?

211
00:19:30,650 --> 00:19:34,460
- No one lays a finger on her!
- Yun!

212
00:19:36,540 --> 00:19:41,510
Mind your own business from now on.
Don't meddle in ours, Eunchae.

213
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:45,860
Don't overreact.

214
00:19:45,860 --> 00:19:47,300
You got it?

215
00:19:51,490 --> 00:19:53,610
- Get out!
- Yun!

216
00:19:53,610 --> 00:19:57,800
Didn't you hear me? Get out of this house!

217
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,520
Eunchae!

218
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:15,220
I'll definitely break your ribs next time.

219
00:20:16,560 --> 00:20:18,300
Eunchae...

220
00:22:44,230 --> 00:22:46,910
Don't let anyone hit you.

221
00:22:46,910 --> 00:22:48,024
Not me.

222
00:22:51,398 --> 00:22:53,784
Not Eunchae. No one.

223
00:22:54,140 --> 00:22:57,440
If someone does this again,

224
00:22:59,480 --> 00:23:01,500
I'm going to kill them.

225
00:23:03,760 --> 00:23:09,500
Be it Eunchae, or myself.

226
00:23:09,500 --> 00:23:11,310
I'll kill them all.

227
00:23:13,820 --> 00:23:19,540
Don't do anything you'll get hit for.

228
00:23:21,220 --> 00:23:23,370
You'll die too.

229
00:23:26,260 --> 00:23:27,890
And I'll die.

230
00:23:37,540 --> 00:23:39,190
I'm sorry.

231
00:23:40,820 --> 00:23:42,810
I was wrong.

232
00:23:48,050 --> 00:23:52,620
I won't be that way again. I'm sorry.

233
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:11,150
Poor baby.

234
00:24:12,220 --> 00:24:14,010
Are you lost?

235
00:24:16,700 --> 00:24:20,030
Don't cry. Don't cry, okay?

236
00:24:20,030 --> 00:24:23,380
I'll find your mother for you.

237
00:24:23,380 --> 00:24:25,350
Good girls don't cry.

238
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:29,440
Santa Claus doesn't give presents to children who cry.

239
00:24:29,440 --> 00:24:31,570
So don't cry.

240
00:24:48,220 --> 00:24:49,710
Hello?

241
00:24:50,430 --> 00:24:53,000
Is this Saetbyul's mother?

242
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,790
Hi, I'm Song Eunchae.

243
00:25:07,010 --> 00:25:08,380
Bye!

244
00:25:53,660 --> 00:25:55,840
What's the capital of Australia?

245
00:25:57,830 --> 00:26:00,540
You don't know your country's capital?

246
00:26:02,430 --> 00:26:03,940
Canberra.

247
00:26:05,080 --> 00:26:07,400
Isn't it Sydney?

248
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:08,920
Canberra.

249
00:26:11,590 --> 00:26:13,710
When did it change?

250
00:26:15,570 --> 00:26:17,770
What about the capital of Korea?

251
00:26:20,450 --> 00:26:21,900
Seoul.

252
00:26:25,840 --> 00:26:28,220
So you're not crazy.

253
00:26:35,020 --> 00:26:38,300
Then fine. Let's go out.

254
00:27:54,900 --> 00:27:56,750
Are you embarrassed?

255
00:27:58,150 --> 00:28:01,760
Are you too shy to look me in my face?

256
00:28:04,310 --> 00:28:06,980
You're introverted, I see.

257
00:28:13,040 --> 00:28:17,350
I didn't think so.

258
00:28:23,270 --> 00:28:25,020
Say "ahh."

259
00:28:25,660 --> 00:28:31,750
Don't be embarrassed.
This is what couples do when they go out.

260
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:34,530
It's called being affectionate.

261
00:28:35,950 --> 00:28:37,810
Ahh!

262
00:28:42,170 --> 00:28:45,130
Are you being shy again?

263
00:28:45,130 --> 00:28:48,060
You're so cute.

264
00:28:48,060 --> 00:28:49,800
Please be quiet.

265
00:28:51,830 --> 00:28:53,080
What?

266
00:28:54,710 --> 00:28:59,400
I'll be asleep for five minutes, so please...
Be quiet.

267
00:29:02,130 --> 00:29:03,320
Okay.

268
00:31:53,670 --> 00:31:57,140
Oh my gosh.

269
00:31:57,140 --> 00:31:58,380
Are you okay?

270
00:31:58,380 --> 00:32:02,680
Hey! Wake up, sir!

271
00:32:03,370 --> 00:32:05,890
Wow, a golden egg!

272
00:32:09,350 --> 00:32:10,580
Have some.

273
00:32:10,580 --> 00:32:12,430
It's okay. You eat it.

274
00:32:12,430 --> 00:32:14,260
Eat it!

275
00:32:14,260 --> 00:32:16,730
I don't eat food others ate.

276
00:32:18,020 --> 00:32:20,260
But Eunchae does.

277
00:32:21,330 --> 00:32:23,290
She has the stomach for that.

278
00:32:24,690 --> 00:32:27,570
- Am I a stranger?
- Sorry.

279
00:32:28,650 --> 00:32:31,080
It's just how I am.

280
00:32:31,080 --> 00:32:33,710
I don't even eat my mother's leftovers.

281
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:43,010
Where are you going?

282
00:32:43,010 --> 00:32:44,450
The bathroom.

283
00:32:54,750 --> 00:32:59,460
Did you get home safe, Eunchae?

284
00:33:00,750 --> 00:33:02,550
About before...

285
00:33:03,410 --> 00:33:06,300
I was out of line.

286
00:33:07,590 --> 00:33:09,550
You're not upset, are you?

287
00:33:10,080 --> 00:33:15,010
Actually, I didn't mean to take it out on you.
Why isn't she answering?

288
00:33:15,010 --> 00:33:16,380
Hello?

289
00:33:17,610 --> 00:33:22,680
Hello? Isn't this Song Eunchae's cell phone?

290
00:33:22,680 --> 00:33:24,970
The owner has fainted.

291
00:33:24,970 --> 00:33:25,920
What?

292
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:28,690
Her dad said he's on his way.

293
00:33:30,130 --> 00:33:32,070
Where is she?

294
00:33:39,130 --> 00:33:42,050
Sir, sir! Please wake up.

295
00:33:42,050 --> 00:33:44,770
They must have drank a lot.

296
00:33:44,770 --> 00:33:46,220
Are you okay?

297
00:33:49,060 --> 00:33:52,380
They won't even budge.

298
00:33:54,480 --> 00:33:56,060
Pardon me!

299
00:33:56,980 --> 00:33:58,570
Excuse me.

300
00:34:04,820 --> 00:34:11,120
They astonishingly fainted while kissing.

301
00:34:11,120 --> 00:34:13,290
Eunchae!

302
00:34:13,290 --> 00:34:16,160
It's your dad!

303
00:34:16,160 --> 00:34:18,130
Eunchae! Your dad is here.

304
00:34:19,670 --> 00:34:22,180
She's sound asleep.

305
00:34:22,180 --> 00:34:27,140
She passes out like this when she's drunk.

306
00:34:27,140 --> 00:34:28,570
I see.

307
00:34:28,570 --> 00:34:30,820
Eunchae!

308
00:34:31,740 --> 00:34:33,470
I can't pull them apart.

309
00:34:41,588 --> 00:34:42,840
Isn't that Choi Yun?

310
00:34:42,840 --> 00:34:44,790
Yun!

311
00:34:44,790 --> 00:34:46,560
What happened?

312
00:34:46,560 --> 00:34:52,810
These two were drinking and then they kissed and...

313
00:34:52,810 --> 00:34:55,930
Hey! Help me.

314
00:35:00,090 --> 00:35:05,160
Get up!

315
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:08,720
Help me lift her.

316
00:35:09,560 --> 00:35:11,330
What happened?

317
00:35:11,330 --> 00:35:15,820
How did Muhyeok and Eunchae end up together?

318
00:35:17,730 --> 00:35:20,960
Is he someone you know?

319
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:21,870
Yes.

320
00:35:21,870 --> 00:35:24,180
How do you know him?

321
00:35:24,180 --> 00:35:26,130
He's like my brother.

322
00:35:28,070 --> 00:35:29,750
What does he do?

323
00:35:31,150 --> 00:35:33,080
I'm not sure.

324
00:35:37,380 --> 00:35:38,770
Yun!

325
00:35:38,770 --> 00:35:40,530
Yes?

326
00:35:40,530 --> 00:35:43,240
What are some things Eunchae likes?

327
00:35:43,240 --> 00:35:45,880
Chicken feet, shellfish, crackers and rice.

328
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:47,170
What doesn't she like?

329
00:35:47,170 --> 00:35:52,200
Ghosts, orangutans, hospitals, spicy noodles.

330
00:35:52,200 --> 00:35:53,970
Why do you ask?

331
00:35:55,850 --> 00:36:02,180
Because I'm her father...
Yet I don't know a thing about her.

332
00:36:02,180 --> 00:36:06,570
You've spent more time with her than me, right?

333
00:36:06,570 --> 00:36:07,660
Yes.

334
00:36:07,660 --> 00:36:15,180
You probably know her more than I do. Right?

335
00:36:16,530 --> 00:36:18,730
Is Eunchae...

336
00:36:18,730 --> 00:36:19,860
Yes?

337
00:36:22,530 --> 00:36:25,421
Is Eunchae...

338
00:36:25,726 --> 00:36:27,720
Promiscuous?

339
00:36:31,070 --> 00:36:32,100
What?

340
00:36:52,770 --> 00:36:54,070
Good night!

341
00:37:52,580 --> 00:37:53,800
You rascal.

342
00:41:14,300 --> 00:41:17,440
What? Let go.

343
00:41:20,100 --> 00:41:22,230
You're so strange.

344
00:41:22,230 --> 00:41:24,720
Mom said to fold the blankets!

345
00:41:24,720 --> 00:41:29,030
Just leave it. I'll fold it later.

346
00:41:29,030 --> 00:41:31,980
What? Did you wet the bed?

347
00:41:33,420 --> 00:41:36,080
Minchae, conference time!

348
00:41:36,080 --> 00:41:37,100
What?

349
00:41:41,850 --> 00:41:47,650
What secret is it that
we have to be under the covers?

350
00:41:48,980 --> 00:41:51,720
I'm late for school.

351
00:41:53,710 --> 00:41:56,470
Who brought me home yesterday?

352
00:41:56,470 --> 00:41:57,970
Dad did.

353
00:41:57,970 --> 00:42:04,420
Mom's having a fit because of you
so run like hell when you see her.

354
00:42:05,770 --> 00:42:08,900
Would... Would you look at my lips?

355
00:42:09,510 --> 00:42:11,890
What about them?

356
00:42:13,630 --> 00:42:17,220
How are my lips? Does it look they've been kissed?

357
00:42:17,220 --> 00:42:18,290
What?

358
00:42:18,990 --> 00:42:23,660
I'm not sure if it was a dream or not.

359
00:42:23,660 --> 00:42:26,480
I can't tell.

360
00:42:27,260 --> 00:42:29,830
Look at them.

361
00:42:29,830 --> 00:42:31,990
Do they look like they've been kissed?

362
00:42:33,710 --> 00:42:36,530
What do kissed lips look like anyway?

363
00:42:36,530 --> 00:42:39,600
I wouldn't know. Since I've never kissed anyone.

364
00:42:39,600 --> 00:42:41,780
What did you do yesterday?

365
00:42:41,780 --> 00:42:43,890
I know, right?

366
00:42:43,890 --> 00:42:47,600
But you've read a lot of weird books,
so wouldn't you know?

367
00:42:47,600 --> 00:42:52,370
I wouldn't know, either...

368
00:42:52,370 --> 00:42:54,590
Want me to get the magnifying glass?

369
00:43:09,170 --> 00:43:13,170
Your lips seem bruised and swollen.

370
00:43:13,170 --> 00:43:15,060
Push them out more.

371
00:43:20,560 --> 00:43:25,480
According to my calculations, you did kiss.

372
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:27,720
What am I going to do?

373
00:43:27,720 --> 00:43:30,830
They say the body remembers what your brain doesn't.

374
00:43:30,830 --> 00:43:34,730
Do it again so we can confirm our findings. With him.

375
00:43:34,730 --> 00:43:35,730
What?

376
00:43:35,730 --> 00:43:36,930
Kiss.

377
00:43:36,930 --> 00:43:38,330
Are you crazy?

378
00:43:38,330 --> 00:43:41,910
Not for anything dirty. Just forget it!

379
00:43:44,680 --> 00:43:47,190
Hey! Ouch!

380
00:44:08,040 --> 00:44:11,730
I'm not liking these dishes.

381
00:44:11,730 --> 00:44:15,680
Where might the Italian china be?

382
00:44:34,690 --> 00:44:36,440
Don't move a step!

383
00:44:42,300 --> 00:44:45,390
Who are you?

384
00:44:45,390 --> 00:44:47,510
You're hurt, stay still!

385
00:44:48,420 --> 00:44:51,960
Aren't you Eunchae's boyfriend?

386
00:45:00,890 --> 00:45:05,950
But why are you here?

387
00:45:09,830 --> 00:45:11,560
Where's the medicine?

388
00:45:12,490 --> 00:45:15,930
Yun!

389
00:45:15,930 --> 00:45:17,590
Where's the medicine?

390
00:45:17,590 --> 00:45:20,090
Yun!

391
00:45:20,090 --> 00:45:22,320
Son!

392
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:23,930
Son!

393
00:45:24,600 --> 00:45:26,510
Son!

394
00:45:27,320 --> 00:45:29,480
Yun is asleep!

395
00:45:29,480 --> 00:45:31,780
Where's the medicine?

396
00:45:31,780 --> 00:45:36,740
Yun!

397
00:45:36,740 --> 00:45:39,770
Yun!

398
00:45:40,470 --> 00:45:43,450
Yun!

399
00:45:44,930 --> 00:45:46,290
Yun!

400
00:45:47,140 --> 00:45:48,670
Yun!

401
00:45:49,840 --> 00:45:53,030
Yun!

402
00:45:53,030 --> 00:45:55,560
What's going on?

403
00:45:55,560 --> 00:45:59,120
Who is that man?

404
00:45:59,120 --> 00:46:01,600
Who? Ah, that's Muhyeok.

405
00:46:01,600 --> 00:46:03,990
Why is he at our house?

406
00:46:03,990 --> 00:46:08,570
I brought him over last night. He was too drunk.

407
00:46:08,570 --> 00:46:12,660
I told you not to bring just anyone in!

408
00:46:14,320 --> 00:46:17,700
But he was drunk and we don't know where he lives.

409
00:46:17,700 --> 00:46:20,000
You don't know where he lives?
You don't even know him well!

410
00:46:20,000 --> 00:46:22,780
Why bring him here? Are you a common man?

411
00:46:22,780 --> 00:46:25,020
You're a celebrity!

412
00:46:25,020 --> 00:46:27,060
Quiet. He'll hear us.

413
00:46:27,060 --> 00:46:30,420
Who do you take after that you can act this way?

414
00:46:30,420 --> 00:46:32,880
Since you're my mother, I probably take after you.

415
00:46:33,510 --> 00:46:35,920
I got to take a leak, I'll be back.

416
00:46:35,920 --> 00:46:40,570
That guy scares me. Tell him to leave, please.

417
00:46:40,570 --> 00:46:43,770
What's scary about him? He won't bite.

418
00:46:43,770 --> 00:46:46,130
I'm going to wash, so just stay around.

419
00:46:46,130 --> 00:46:47,770
Hey!

420
00:46:48,340 --> 00:46:51,300
Then I'll go with you to the bathroom.

421
00:46:54,930 --> 00:46:57,050
Were you hurt?

422
00:46:57,050 --> 00:47:02,080
Yeah, I was hurt a lot. I'm bleeding.

423
00:47:02,080 --> 00:47:06,100
You're driving me crazy.
Let's put some medicine on it.

424
00:47:52,720 --> 00:47:56,320
- Stop!
- No!

425
00:48:00,030 --> 00:48:01,750
Let me borrow this for a while.

426
00:48:07,500 --> 00:48:10,930
Am I a joke to you? Do I look like a pushover?

427
00:48:13,120 --> 00:48:18,550
If you show up again, you're dead meat!

428
00:48:27,280 --> 00:48:28,930
Hey, hey!

429
00:49:12,080 --> 00:49:13,720
Will she be okay?

430
00:49:13,720 --> 00:49:18,590
She'll be fine. It was a good thing
to stop her bleeding.

431
00:49:24,940 --> 00:49:29,900
Seaweed rolls for sale!

432
00:49:29,900 --> 00:49:31,500
Seaweed rolls for sale!

433
00:49:31,500 --> 00:49:35,880
Seaweed rolls for sale! Rice cakes for sale!

434
00:49:35,880 --> 00:49:37,530
Rice cakes for sale! Seaweed rolls for sale!

435
00:49:37,530 --> 00:49:40,510
Rice cakes for sale! Seaweed rolls for sale!

436
00:49:46,580 --> 00:49:50,120
Rice cakes for sale!

437
00:49:50,120 --> 00:49:52,020
Rice cakes for sale!

438
00:49:52,020 --> 00:49:53,820
Seaweed rolls!

439
00:49:53,820 --> 00:49:55,610
Rice cakes for sale!

440
00:49:55,610 --> 00:49:56,790
Seaweed rolls for sale!

441
00:49:56,790 --> 00:49:59,240
How's business?

442
00:49:59,240 --> 00:50:01,780
- Hey!
- Hi!

443
00:50:03,170 --> 00:50:05,480
You're bleeding!

444
00:50:20,590 --> 00:50:23,040
You should go the hospital.

445
00:50:32,580 --> 00:50:36,640
Why did you tell me?

446
00:50:38,500 --> 00:50:42,960
My mother... Why did you tell me about her?

447
00:50:46,270 --> 00:50:50,670
What did you expect me to do about it?

448
00:50:53,280 --> 00:50:55,700
What do you want me to do about it, you old man?

449
00:51:00,660 --> 00:51:03,500
Do whatever you want.

450
00:51:03,500 --> 00:51:06,010
Whatever you want.

451
00:51:08,090 --> 00:51:12,180
All done. Go to the hospital.

452
00:51:12,180 --> 00:51:13,830
My mother...

453
00:51:16,860 --> 00:51:18,500
That lady...

454
00:51:20,750 --> 00:51:23,390
Did she wrong you, too?

455
00:51:24,700 --> 00:51:25,850
Yes.

456
00:51:26,950 --> 00:51:30,860
Galchi, let's have dinner together tonight.

457
00:51:30,860 --> 00:51:33,650
- Let's make galchi fish.
- Okay.

458
00:52:00,540 --> 00:52:04,430
Kang Minju has publicly declared
her relationship with Choi Yun.

459
00:52:04,430 --> 00:52:07,780
I've had a crush on her every day
for the past three years

460
00:52:09,530 --> 00:52:14,420
For her alone, I can give up everything in the world.

461
00:52:15,650 --> 00:52:19,660
Without her, I don't feel alive.

462
00:52:19,660 --> 00:52:23,320
What are your feelings toward Choi Yun?

463
00:52:23,320 --> 00:52:28,450
Choi Yun is the nicest and most purehearted man I know.

464
00:52:28,450 --> 00:52:31,480
I've done him a lot of wrong,

465
00:52:31,480 --> 00:52:34,130
But I'm determined to make it up to him.

466
00:52:34,900 --> 00:52:37,390
I didn't think love was real,

467
00:52:37,390 --> 00:52:40,290
But through Yun, I've come to believe in it.

468
00:52:41,900 --> 00:52:44,420
I'm so happy and I support him.

469
00:52:44,420 --> 00:52:50,450
I trust and respect my son's decision
one hundred percent.

470
00:52:50,450 --> 00:52:55,710
If Yun chose her, I'm sure she's a good girl.

471
00:53:02,220 --> 00:53:04,710
I'm going to love her like a daughter.

472
00:53:07,410 --> 00:53:12,480
He's scary. Just tell him to leave.

473
00:53:12,480 --> 00:53:14,360
Yun!

474
00:53:14,850 --> 00:53:18,320
Son!

475
00:53:22,160 --> 00:53:27,000
Do whatever you want.

476
00:53:30,900 --> 00:53:34,690
Both of them have opened their hearts
and the public agrees they match well.

477
00:53:34,690 --> 00:53:37,430
They're rising in popularity.

478
00:53:37,430 --> 00:53:41,560
Due to today's conference,
fans are reacting hugely.

479
00:54:04,830 --> 00:54:07,440
Live happily, Yun!

480
00:54:07,440 --> 00:54:12,200
If you hurt him, I'll make sure you pay, Minju!

481
00:54:13,530 --> 00:54:17,350
Be happy together!

482
00:55:06,640 --> 00:55:10,860
I've got to go to the studio.
I don't think I can drive you.

483
00:55:10,860 --> 00:55:14,280
It's okay. That's why I brought my car.

484
00:55:15,540 --> 00:55:17,920
I'll call you. Get home safe.

485
00:55:40,670 --> 00:55:42,120
How can I help you?

486
00:55:45,860 --> 00:55:47,470
Hey!

487
00:55:47,470 --> 00:55:50,900
Lady! Get out.

488
00:55:57,270 --> 00:55:58,670
"Lady"?

489
00:56:08,686 --> 00:56:10,736
[Episode 5 Preview]

490
00:56:10,966 --> 00:56:13,379
- What, mom?
- So sue me!

491
00:56:13,379 --> 00:56:14,955
I'll go on the blind date.

492
00:56:15,474 --> 00:56:18,666
Tell me the truth.
What exactly don't you like about me?

493
00:56:19,004 --> 00:56:22,038
I really don't like how you look.

494
00:56:23,306 --> 00:56:26,626
Lady! Get out.

495
00:56:27,049 --> 00:56:28,981
Are you trying to hit on me?

496
00:56:30,689 --> 00:56:33,662
- Do you like me too?
- No!

497
00:56:33,662 --> 00:56:35,856
Then why poke a man minding his own business?

498
00:56:37,006 --> 00:56:39,350
I'm going to tell my son and have this place torn down

499
00:56:39,350 --> 00:56:41,695
and have a new building built on top of it.

500
00:56:43,666 --> 00:56:47,426
What are you doing? Stop!

501
00:56:48,544 --> 00:56:51,822
How would it feel to be up there?

502
00:56:53,150 --> 00:56:58,770
Would it look much better than it does from here?

503
00:56:58,770 --> 00:57:00,622
If you're so curious, then why don't you go?

504
00:57:00,622 --> 00:57:06,204
I'll be going there soon.
